{
  "an2.42:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 2 ",
  "an2.42:0.2": "5. Parisavagga ",
  "an2.42:1.0": "42 ",
  "an2.42:1.1": "“Dvemā, bhikkhave, parisā. ",
  "an2.42:1.2": "Katamā dve? ",
  "an2.42:1.3": "Uttānā ca parisā gambhīrā ca parisā. ",
  "an2.42:1.4": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, uttānā parisā? ",
  "an2.42:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, yassaṁ parisāyaṁ bhikkhū uddhatā honti unnaḷā capalā mukharā vikiṇṇavācā muṭṭhassatī asampajānā asamāhitā vibbhantacittā pākatindriyā. ",
  "an2.42:1.6": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, uttānā parisā. ",
  "an2.42:2.1": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, gambhīrā parisā? ",
  "an2.42:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, yassaṁ parisāyaṁ bhikkhū anuddhatā honti anunnaḷā acapalā amukharā avikiṇṇavācā upaṭṭhitassatī sampajānā samāhitā ekaggacittā saṁvutindriyā. ",
  "an2.42:2.3": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, gambhīrā parisā. ",
  "an2.42:2.4": "Imā kho, bhikkhave, dve parisā. ",
  "an2.42:2.5": "Etadaggaṁ, bhikkhave, imāsaṁ dvinnaṁ parisānaṁ yadidaṁ gambhīrā parisā”ti. ",
  "an2.43:1.0": "43 ",
  "an2.43:1.1": "“Dvemā, bhikkhave, parisā. ",
  "an2.43:1.2": "Katamā dve? ",
  "an2.43:1.3": "Vaggā ca parisā samaggā ca parisā. ",
  "an2.43:1.4": "Katamā ca, bhikkhave, vaggā parisā? ",
  "an2.43:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, yassaṁ parisāyaṁ bhikkhū bhaṇḍanajātā kalahajātā vivādāpannā aññamaññaṁ mukhasattīhi vitudantā viharanti. ",
  "an2.43:1.6": "Ayaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, vaggā parisā. "